/-!
# The missing assembly of `cyclotomic_unramified_and_residue` (NK file, line 537)

`Submission.NK.NumberTheory.NumberField.Completion.exists_galois_unramified_extension_of_inertiaDeg`
carries two `sorry`s:

* line 537 — the third conjunct of `cyclotomic_unramified_and_residue` (the residue field of
  `L(ζ_m)` at `q'` is generated by the reduction of a primitive `m`-th root of unity);
* line 606 — `f(q'|q) = n` for the cyclotomic level `m = q₀ ^ n - 1`.

**Both are already bypassed**:

* for the *second*, the statement (a Galois level `L' ⊇ L` with `q' | q` unramified of inertia
  degree `n`) already has a `sorry`-free rebuild with the *same statement* in
  `Work.Sha2Lib.exists_galois_unramified_extension_inertiaDeg`
  (`Submission/Work/Sha2Lib/exists_galois_unramified_extension_inertiaDeg.lean`), so the NK
  file's `sorry` at line 606 is an orphan and no consumer needs it;
* for the *first*, the third conjunct is *verbatim* the landed
  `Work.Sha2Lib.residueField_cyclotomic_generated`
  (`Submission/Work/Sha2Lib/residueField_cyclotomic_generated.lean`), and the other two conjuncts
  are the NK file's own proved `ramificationIdx_cyclotomic_eq_one` and
  `isPrimitiveRoot_reduction`.

The theorem below is the missing *assembly*: the two-line proof of the NK file's
`cyclotomic_unramified_and_residue` from those three proved ingredients.  It is stated here under a
fresh name so that nothing in this module depends on an open declaration of the NK file.  (The
corresponding fix of the NK file — replacing its `sorry` by
`exact residueField_cyclotomic_generated q hq q' hqq'` — is a one-liner for that file's owner; the
NK file is not this lane's file and is not edited here.)
-/

namespace Work.Sha2Lib

/-- **`cyclotomic_unramified_and_residue`, proved** (the statement is *character for character* the
NK file's theorem): `e(q'|q) = 1`, the reduction of a primitive `m`-th root of unity stays
primitive, and it generates the residue field.  The first two conjuncts are the NK file's proved
lemmas, the third is `Work.Sha2Lib.residueField_cyclotomic_generated`. -/
theorem cyclotomic_unramified_and_residue_proved {L : Type} [Field L] [NumberField L]
    (q : IsDedekindDomain.HeightOneSpectrum (NumberField.RingOfIntegers L)) {m : ℕ} [NeZero m]
    (hq : ((m : ℕ) : NumberField.RingOfIntegers L) ∉ q.asIdeal)
    (q' : IsDedekindDomain.HeightOneSpectrum
      (NumberField.RingOfIntegers (CyclotomicField m L)))
    (hqq' : q'.asIdeal.LiesOver q.asIdeal) :
    q'.asIdeal.ramificationIdx (NumberField.RingOfIntegers L) = 1 ∧
    (∀ ζ : NumberField.RingOfIntegers (CyclotomicField m L),
      IsPrimitiveRoot (ζ : CyclotomicField m L) m →
      IsPrimitiveRoot (Ideal.Quotient.mk q'.asIdeal ζ) m) ∧
    (∀ ζ : NumberField.RingOfIntegers (CyclotomicField m L),
      IsPrimitiveRoot (ζ : CyclotomicField m L) m →
      Algebra.adjoin (NumberField.RingOfIntegers L ⧸ q.asIdeal)
        ({Ideal.Quotient.mk q'.asIdeal ζ} : Set
          (NumberField.RingOfIntegers (CyclotomicField m L) ⧸ q'.asIdeal)) = ⊤) :=
  ⟨Commons.NumberTheory.NumberField.Completion.ramificationIdx_cyclotomic_eq_one q hq q' hqq',
    fun ζ hζ =>
      Commons.NumberTheory.NumberField.Completion.isPrimitiveRoot_reduction q hq q' hqq' hζ,
    residueField_cyclotomic_generated q hq q' hqq'⟩

end Work.Sha2Lib
